Non-finite guard for CHORD (PPO) on episode 07 (reproduce/README.md, "CHORD (PPO), episode 07").

Applies to NVIDIA's FlashCHORD, video_to_data @ 8c778f905cb35f76f8e6cd6e2ea486da4fb9e0ef, folder
robotic_grounding/flash_chord, in a separate copy of the checkout:  git -C <copy>/robotic_grounding/flash_chord apply <this file>
After the physics substeps of each environment step, a world whose joint state is non-finite gets its solver
accelerations cleared and its episode ended with zero reward, so the environment resets it; the trainer prints how
many worlds were reset. Worlds with finite states are not changed. The patched files keep NVIDIA's license header
(SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0).

